1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,090
Listen to a campus radio announcement.

2
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:10,100
Woman: The due date for submitting photographs to the Campus Photography Contest is today at 3:00 PM.

3
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,840
If you would like to enter but have not yet submitted a photograph

4
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:16,000
remember to do so today.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,340
After all submissions are in

6
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:22,260
selected photography students will judge the photos and declare a winner.

7
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:27,190
The winner's name and winning photo will be printed in the campus newspaper,

8
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:32,119
and all photographs entered will be posted on the university website next Wednesday.
